bot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165360152,"discussion_id":"35843814a865abb668fd5c0017be5571efc7cfed","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要优化了`repeat_interleave`算子内核的性能和资源利用率。修复了在处理数据块（特别是尾部数据）时，因输出缓冲区管理不当和存在冗余数据复制操作而导致的效率问题，使内核执行逻辑更加高效。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改聚焦于`CopyXToMatchOut`和`ProcessCpMatchToUb`两个核心函数。核心调整包括：1) 将结果复制到全局内存的操作（`CopyMatchOutToY`）从条件判断中移出，确保每个数据块处理后都能及时输出；2) 重构输出张量的分配逻辑，仅在需要处理新数据块时才重新分配，避免了不必要的开销；3) 移除`ProcessCpMatchToUb`函数循环内的冗余输出调用，统一在`CopyXToMatchOut`函数内处理，使数据流更清晰、高效。","created_at":"2026-03-16T14:47:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T14:47:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165360358,"discussion_id":"51b9bd3420c9c45d45891592974ae25ceeacd8f2","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-16T14:49:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T14:49:02+08:00","user":{"id":"684598ba4229be333029be60","login":"yourealize","object_id":"684598ba4229be333029be60","name":"陈展熹","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yourealize"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165360531,"discussion_id":"be14ca4b574730f0d55028dd9b59862c51b91368","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=037f7a2dbba6432d8b1c5f5e7ac4b380&projectName=CANN'>037f7a2dbba6432d8b1c5f5e7ac4b380</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下